# EVIDENCE-ONLY PROJECT ANSWERS [CRITICAL]

Project-related claims MUST cite at least one of:

1. **Codebase** (runtime today) — file path + line range
2. **Confluence / wiki** (documented intent) — title + page ID (+ URL)
3. **OpenAPI / Swagger** — path + schema when HTTP contract matters
4. **Database** — read-only SQL + summarized result (after env is named)

If evidence is insufficient: state that clearly, ask 1–2 targeted questions, STOP guessing.

When code and Confluence disagree: report both + Finding (Rule QA.2). Do not silently pick one side.

## Jira ticket analysis

When analyzing a Jira ticket with linked Confluence URLs, read those pages in the **same pass** (Rule 44). Prefer Jira MCP; after retries use REST fallback (`config/scripts/get-jira-issue-rest.ps1`) and disclose `Jira source: REST fallback …`.
